# Marker file — opts this project into the quality-gate-precommit hook
# installed at ~/.claude/hooks/quality-gate-precommit.sh.
#
# When this file exists at <project>/.claude/quality-gate-precommit, the
# hook runs lint + secrets scan on staged diffs before every `git commit`
# Claude Code makes. Heavy gates (build, tests) stay manual.
#
# Enable:  touch .claude/quality-gate-precommit
# Disable: rm .claude/quality-gate-precommit
